  "details": "I'd like to see a function added to the content filters where we can toggle it on and off for specific types of content, such as a toggle for avatars and a toggle for worlds. I've had several instances where I've wanted to see someone's avatar, but I couldn't because it was marked as extreme horror, so I'd have to completely disable the filter to see the avatar. Alternatively, an override feature would be nice so you can click on someone's avatar and show it temporarily for example.",
